OL,3,GNEWSAKing reveals 'cheese and beans' as
OL,4,Aspud of choice on city visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FForget coronation chicken or tuna mayo,
OL,7,FKing Charles III is apparently a fan of
OL,8,Fthe classic cheese and beans
OL,9,Fcombination when it comes to what he
OL,10,Flikes on his jacket potato.
OL,12,FThe King's jacket of choice was
OL,13,Frevealed by the Preston-based food
OL,14,Fentrepreneurs and social media stars
OL,15,FSpudBros.
OL,17,FKing Charles, who is also the Duke of
OL,18,FLancaster, stopped at their van during
OL,19,Fhis first visit to Lancashire since his
OL,20,Fcoronation.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
