OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAKing reveals 'cheese and beans' as
OL,4,Aspud of choice on city visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FJacob Nelson, who runs the van with
OL,7,Fbrother Harley, said they asked the
OL,8,FKing what his favourite filling was,
OL,9,Fand he said "cheese and beans", adding:
OL,10,F"It's a classic."
